  "content_id": "16136212",
  "title": "Tron TRX Network Fees",
  "description": "Tron (TRX) Network – The Sun Chain\nTron offers fast and cheap TRX transactions—but sending tokens like USDT (TRC20) can cost significantly...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ5NAC2GHA5ZNZSJJ5SZ81G\">Tron (TRX) Network – The Sun Chain</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Tron offers fast and cheap TRX transactions—but sending tokens like <b>USDT</b> (TRC20) can cost significantly more.</p><p class=\"no-margin\">*Fees listed are an estimation and can fluctuate greatly due to network activity and other factors.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ5NAC2KMPWCX8S5JSTKDKZ\">How Tron Fees Work</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>TRX Transfers:</b> Use <b>bandwidth</b>, usually costing around <b>3 to 5 TRX</b>.</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Token Transfers (e.g., USDT):</b> Use <b>energy</b>, often costing <b>30 to 80 TRX</b>.</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>New Wallet Activation:</b> Adds <b>1 to 5 TRX</b> extra if the receiving wallet is empty.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge Wallet automatically calculates fees based on your available bandwidth and energy.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ5NAC2XK0JEWAM2AAPET25\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Flat cost</b> based on transaction type—no manual setting needed.</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Staking TRX</b> can earn free <b>bandwidth and energy</b> to lower or eliminate fees.</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ5NAC266MEXM3KNV8B8FXJ\">Average Costs</h2><div class=\"intercom-interblocks-table-container\"><table role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td><p class=\"no-margin\">Action</p></td><td><p class=\"no-margin\">Average Fee</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class=\"no-margin\">Send TRX</p></td><td><p class=\"no-margin\">~4 TRX</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class=\"no-margin\">Send USDT (TRC20)</p></td><td><p class=\"no-margin\">30–80 TRX</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class=\"no-margin\">New Wallet Activation</p></td><td><p class=\"no-margin\">+1–5 TRX</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ5WNM775F6QC05J4ZVBDBH\">How Staking TRX Helps</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">By staking TRX, you <b>generate free bandwidth and energy</b> every day.<br>This can cover TRX sends and even lower the high energy costs for token transfers like USDT—saving you TRX over time.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ5WNM7K9PEGK9PAN9KKN8Y\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Tron is one of the fastest and most affordable networks for basic TRX sends.<br>For frequent USDT or token transactions, staking TRX is the smartest way to avoid high fees.<br>Edge Wallet makes fee handling and tracking simple, whether you stake or pay as you go.</p>",
